menu "Pico Page diagnostics"
config PICO_PAGE_DIAGNOSTIC_CONSOLE
    bool "Enable local USB diagnostic commands"
    depends on ESP_CONSOLE_USB_SERIAL_JTAG
    default n
    help
        Enables bounded status, directory listing, input injection, verified
        resource import and current framebuffer export over the local USB Serial JTAG console. Commands
        run on the application task and use the normal reader APIs. This is
        an unauthenticated development interface; disable it for normal builds.
endmenu
